# RoadSOS — Supabase and backend rules

Canonical detail: **`docs/DEVELOPMENT_RULEBOOK.md`** (Phase 2 Data architecture, Phase 5 Security, Phase 4 Location / Overpass).

## Mandatory `[SECURITY]` `[CRITICAL]`

- **RLS on every table** before production writes; migrations committed before client assumes schema.
- **No Gemini or third-party secrets** in Edge Function source committed to repo — use Supabase secrets / GitHub Secrets in CI.
- **Rate limiting** on triage and sensitive Edge Functions; validate request/response **schemas** server-side.
- Overpass / heavy facility fetch: **server-side only** (cron + Edge Function), not mobile client.

## Compliance `[INDIA]`

- Retention (e.g. incident TTL) and DPDP-aligned handling per rulebook; medical data encrypted client-side before storage where applicable.
